01:15:00,000 --> 01:15:06,000
Beat Street is a 1984 American dance drama film featuring New
York City hip hop culture of the early 1980s.

11
01:22:30,000 --> 01:22:36,000
Set in the South Bronx, the film follows the lives of a pair of brothers and their group of friends, all of whom are
devoted to various elements of early hip hop culture, including breakdancing, DJing and graffiti.

12
01:30:00,000 --> 01:30:06,000
The film explores themes of dance, rap music,
hip-hop, rhyme battle, disc jockey.

13
01:37:30,000 --> 01:37:36,000
The tone is emotional and intense.
